01:39.067 --> 01:41.267
Think of how vaccines travel.

01:41.267 --> 01:45.300
They have to be kept cold throughout
their route right from the factory

01:45.300 --> 01:49.067
to when they reach the doctor.
And even in one place in the middle,

01:49.067 --> 01:51.100
if they can't be kept cold,
they get spoilt.

01:51.100 --> 01:56.100
The same thing applies to leads as well.
Every lead starts to go cold if they

01:56.100 --> 01:58.700
